# Optimize build context - exclude unnecessary files
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/README.md
**/readme.md
**/*.md
**/docs
**/output
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/.Python
**/env
**/venv
**/.venv
**/pip-log.txt
**/pip-delete-this-directory.txt
**/.tox
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/.cache
**/nosetests.xml
**/coverage.xml
**/*.cover
**/*.log
**/.git
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.hypothesis

# Large data files
**/data/fit_files/*.fit
**/data/maps/*
**/Downloads/*
**/database/*.duckdb

# IDE files
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/tags

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Build artifacts
**/build
**/dist
**/*.egg-info